message: "If you use TSOpt, please cite it as below."
title: "TSOpt: Training Set Optimisation for Genomic Prediction in Any Crop"
type: software
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Waseem
    email: waseemhussain@plantnura.com
