license: LicenseRef-TSOpt-Free-Licence
keywords:
  - genomic selection
  - training population optimisation
  - CDmean
  - plant breeding
  - sparse testing
  - R
abstract: >-
  TSOpt chooses which genotyped candidates to phenotype so that genomic prediction works best. It computes
  the CDmean criterion exactly by rank-one updates of the prediction error variance, is robust to the
  unknown heritability, and covers inbred, hybrid, testcross, clonal and genebank material, several traits
  and environments (sparse testing), major genes, historical data and plot costs. Free for everyone.
